WEBVTT

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:07.740
What's the matter?

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:25.620
I'm sorry, Juliana.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.480
Burckhardt...

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.490
A demon?

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:30.730
No...

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:33.370
He was such a righteous man.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:37.380
If I had only noticed
the change in him sooner...

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.210
No.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.380
It isn't your fault.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.380
Are the others okay?

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.920
Y-Yes.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:49.890
I see... That's good.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:54.260
But the enemy knows we're here.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:58.620
Traveling at night is dangerous,
but I want to push forward.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.130
You're right.

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:01.400
That's a good idea.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.110
Goodbye.

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:03.130
Wait.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.070
Stay safe.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:06.530
Thank you.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.920
Your Highness!

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.930
The Holy Capital's on fire!

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:18.080
What?

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:09.790
<b>The Expanding Darkness</b>

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:14.780
May all be engulfed in blackness!

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:16.880
May all be engulfed in blackness!

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.000
No, stop!

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:18.870
Let go!

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:20.270
Move it!

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:21.600
Smash it!

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:22.690
Pull it down!

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:24.040
Please spare me!

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.010
Put it out!

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.720
Why are you doing this?

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.720
So that all may be engulfed in blackness!

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:30.690
Stop.

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:31.700
Shut up.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:34.430
I'm going to join the Black Army
so I can survive!

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:37.890
Hurry, this way.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:39.210
Destroy it all!

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:40.610
May all be engulfed in blackness!

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:47.480
Fools! Getting riled up over
a bunch of silly rumors...

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:48.920
Cervantes!

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:52.490
Don't worry. I'm holding back.

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:54.510
My back...

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:55.540
Don't over do it.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:56.710
Give me your hand.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.520
Don't treat me like I'm over the hill!

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:01.100
Focus on evacuating the citizens.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.790
Close off all roads to the central square.

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:07.190
Stop this panic from spreading any further.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.360
Put your backs into it, men!

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:24.450
Apprehend them!

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.130
Looks like things are finally under control.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:46.360
This is all because you people
don't do your job!

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.380
What are...

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:49.260
Please calm down.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.640
For now, let's clean this mess up.

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:52.860
What's the matter?

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:57.310
I ordered the knights to
clean up the city, but...

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.940
Seize him!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.740
Your Highness!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.080
I'm glad you're safe.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:13.690
Save the greetings.

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:15.660
What is going on here?

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:21.530
Since the defeat at the castle,
some of the citizens have been on edge.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:24.090
Riots have started breaking out all over.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.470
A bunch of punks making a racket,

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.840
ranting about joining
the Black Army to survive.

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:32.370
That's...

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:34.230
Holy Princess Juliana!

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:36.560
You cannot save this world!

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:37.350
You!

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:39.330
A kid?

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.270
Aries, release him.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:43.300
But...

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:44.170
Just do it.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.290
If there's something you want to say,
now's your chance.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.300
The Holy King is dead.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:54.210
The holy men at the Great Shrine
won't help us.

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:56.130
But the Black King is different.

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:58.690
He'll spare us if we join the Black Army!

00:05:58.690 --> 00:05:59.290
Nonsense.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:01.460
Who told you that?

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.190
Everyone's saying it.

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:04.410
"Everyone"?

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:06.790
You believe such a rumor?

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:08.550
I don't want to die!

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.790
I'll become a demon and join the Black Army!

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.280
A demon?

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:16.810
Do you understand what that means?

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:25.310
Become a demon and you'll never see
your friends or family or ever again.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:29.520
You'd do that just to save your own skin?

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:32.820
Have you even considered what would happen

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:34.350
to those you leave behind?

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:39.430
We... We fought together all this while.

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:44.240
You swore to fight alongside your comrades.

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:47.090
Why?

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.770
Why did you become a demon?

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:54.310
How could I not have known?

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:57.070
Why couldn't I stop you?

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.400
Your Highness...

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:04.630
What in the world happened?

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:08.520
Burckhardt became a demon.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:11.670
More fires!

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:14.570
Damn it all. There's no end to it.

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:23.820
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:24.700
Louise...

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:26.250
I'm sorry I worried you.

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:32.060
No, this whole situation started
 because I wasn't strong enough.

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:34.340
It isn't your fault.

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:37.940
The three of us have taken on the duties
of the Holy King between us.

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:41.660
We promised to do what we could
to help each other out, did we not?

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.070
Yes.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:47.580
But the fact of the matter is that 
the current situation is becoming grave.

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:51.960
The riots are spreading faster 
than we could have imagined.

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:53.770
At this rate...

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:56.960
What should we do now?

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:21.600
What the?

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.030
Are you all right?

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:28.810
What is this?

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:31.010
Let's report this to Chief Olga.

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:49.140
I'm told that the forces
of the Nine Territories,

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:52.000
led by Shuza,
are stationed near the Holy Capital.

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:53.380
Shuza?

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.510
He's still in the Holy Kingdom?

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:59.790
Shuza's army is still recovering from
their battle with the Black King.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.520
It will be a while until they can move out.

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:05.220
Your Highness.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:09.670
Why don't we have them join
the Black King Suppression Army?

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:12.210
Right.

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:14.720
Shuza would be a invaluable asset.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.810
Let's send a messenger immediately.

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:35.930
Yuri.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:37.210
Phoena.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.590
I'll slow down the blackening.

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:40.990
I'm fine.

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:42.260
Hold out your arm.

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:43.600
I'll be all right.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:44.350
No!

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:56.610
All this time, you've helped me.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:59.020
It's my turn to help you.

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:16.130
Why...

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:23.010
Please, Chronicle.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.090
Please.

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:32.400
Phoena...

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:34.640
It's...

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:42.450
Thank you.

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:57.570
What the heck are they doing, 
skipping out on dinner?

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.100
What?

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:02.470
Hey!

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:02.940
Yu—

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:03.430
Shh!

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:04.600
We're going back.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.580
What?!

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.080
A kid has no business seeing this.

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:08.810
I'm not a kid!

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.220
Shut up, idiot!

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:26.100
It's huge!

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:28.570
Is that the Sage's Tower?

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:30.130
Yeah.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:35.470
It's some kind of weird building,
made using some kind of weird technology.

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:36.510
Wow.

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:39.940
That's super weird, but awesome.

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:45.710
The Sage of Destiny there 
might know where Pirika is.

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:53.810
What the?

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.770
The Sorcerer's Army!

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:08.960
Why are they attacking us?

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:11.650
We've been waiting for you, Volunteer Army.

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:13.250
Melchior.

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:16.040
Where?

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:18.270
Melchior!

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:21.250
We're going to fight the Black King again.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:22.430
Please.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:24.860
Lend us the power of the Sage's Tower.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:31.750
If you want our assistance,
first prove your might.

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:33.900
Velnar!

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:35.270
All right!

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:38.720
No, you don't!

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.230
What firepower...

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:47.720
Damn...

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.270
Aram, get back! It's dangerous.

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:50.030
The carriage!

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:50.590
Got it.

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:51.780
Attack!

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:58.950
This place is never boring.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:18.310
Aram!

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:25.440
You don't have time to worry about others!

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:34.910
My mana can't keep up.

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:38.540
This is over!

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:39.800
Aludra!

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:41.170
Thanks!

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:43.660
Give it up, old hag!

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:46.550
Who are you calling an old hag?!

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:05.280
That kid can transfer mana?

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:10.360
You seem to be having fun, Melchior.

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.070
That is indeed entertaining.

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:15.170
But there'll be a lot of damage.

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:18.210
Sacrifices are necessary
if progress is to be made.

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:21.310
Then why not sacrifice yourself?

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:25.930
You've toyed with them long enough.

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:41.350
That's enough.

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:43.420
No more games.

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:51.670
Y-You're naked?!

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:59.580
Aram, allow me to introduce you.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.630
This is Dilma.

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:03.590
Fatima.

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:06.350
And Melchior.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:10.140
They are the Sages of the Tower.

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:11.310
Nice to meet you.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:17.640
I heard you were gathering an Army,
so I put you through your paces.

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:20.970
Actually, your magic experiments failed,
and you were just taking it out on them.

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:23.950
They're different from how I imagined them.

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:26.400
Everyone says that at first.

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.540
This is the Imperial Castle as it is now.

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:38.820
That's right.

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:41.250
There's something interesting 
going on there.

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:44.820
A High-Density Black Element is being emitted

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:48.840
from the castle non-stop, creating a barrier.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:52.130
Calculations show that its density is double—
no, more than double—that of normal,

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:55.260
causing an unprecedented
blackening of the region.

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:55.260
Shut up.

00:15:57.370 --> 00:16:02.640
Basically, the Black Element barrier has
grown so powerful, no-one can penetrate it.

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:09.020
Tell us, do you believe people will follow you
in this increasingly desperate situation,

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:13.620
despite the fact that
you've already failed once before?

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.050
Well...

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:19.120
We're doing this, regardless.

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:21.320
Very well.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.270
The world's fate is a blank canvas.

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:26.410
The future has yet to be written.

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:29.980
Follow the path you believe to be true.

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:33.370
Do you mean it's up to us what happens next?

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:34.260
Yes.

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:37.270
If that's what the Sage of Destiny says.

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:40.480
<i>She's</i> the Sage of Destiny?

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:41.890
She is.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:44.280
Fatima knows a lot of things.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:45.780
Even though she's naked?

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:50.780
Fatima, if you know anything
about Pirika, please tell us.

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:55.110
Pirika survives.

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:58.020
But is somewhere from which
it is impossible to return by oneself.

00:16:58.020 --> 00:16:59.860
Where is that?

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:06.390
So not even Fatima knows.

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:09.320
There is still hope.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:10.650
Huh?

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:17.330
Also, you must travel to the Maze Pass.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:26.800
Hey, kid.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:31.150
You're new around here.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.520
I'm not a kid.

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:33.490
I'm Aram.

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:34.800
Oh?

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.910
You have a big mouth.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.440
What's up with your body, anyway?

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:42.800
That's the mark of a Sealer.

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:48.520
He's strengthened himself by
carving magic runes into his body.

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:50.860
In other words, he's crazy about fighting.

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:52.030
Clauss.

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:53.480
You weren't at the battle.

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:54.500
Where were you?

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:57.050
It's my day off.

00:17:57.050 --> 00:18:01.880
Is that why you can use that awesome magic?
Because you're a Sealer?

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.480
Wanna see it again?

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:07.040
You're going to get suspended again.

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:12.320
Speaking of which,
you did something interesting yourself.

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:14.870
You can transfer mana, can you?

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:15.700
Yeah.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:19.240
I thought I'd won
when that old hag ran out of mana.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.990
Good job watching out for her.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:23.070
I hate losing.

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:25.080
And if you lose anyway?

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.080
I won't quit until I win.

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:30.700
You're quite the dumbass, too.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:32.060
I'm not <i>quite</i> a dumbass.

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:33.830
I'm a <i>real</i> dumbass.

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:36.340
Is that supposed to be a compliment?

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:40.690
It's important to look at
the battlefield as a whole.

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:45.030
Once you do, you start to see things
that you couldn't otherwise.

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:46.640
Yeah.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:49.340
That was a surprisingly mature comment,
coming from you.

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:54.320
You need to watch carefully
if you're gonna kill <i>everyone</i>.

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.480
Right.

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:58.860
Aren't you guys going to
fight the Black Army?

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.510
We are fighting them.

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.700
The ones that attack here, anyway.

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:09.260
We, the Sorcerer's Army, can't act
without orders from those weird Sages.

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:11.350
I see.

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:17.390
I apologize.

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:21.130
We didn't want to fight you, either.

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:23.090
Don't worry about it, Katya.

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:27.760
I know you're at the mercy 
of those crazy Sages.

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:31.780
Is someone speaking ill of me?

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:33.160
You're imagining things.

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:36.000
So, when are you leaving?

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:38.590
Unfortunately,
I'm going to be staying for a while.

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:40.110
So will I.

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:45.950
We came all the way here to find out
how to take on the Holy Castle, after all.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:49.780
After you ran away from here
all those years ago, too.

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:53.390
Don't worry. I'll stay away from your room.

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:57.460
I'm not going to show you
my newest paper on magic theory.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:00.470
Don't worry. I'll find it myself.

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:05.060
Then I'll set some magic traps
where I hide it.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:09.400
I wonder if your theory-obsessed magic
will work on me.

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:13.800
I'm sure we'll see the failings
of your half-assed applied magic.

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:20.060
Geez.

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:38.200
All that and we still don't know
Pirika's whereabouts.

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:39.650
Sadly.

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:43.000
We'll have to ask Yggdra
at the island of sprites.

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:43.880
Yeah.

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:48.220
I'd like to go there immediately, but...

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:51.360
Let's go to the Maze Pass first.

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:55.520
Fatima doesn't offer advice
unless there's a reason.

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:57.140
I know.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:21:01.260
Juliana asked us to check on the area, too.

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:02.760
This is a good opportunity.

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:05.910
We'll come with you.

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:10.610
I haven't had enough action lately.

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.070
Awesome!

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:14.450
You're coming with us?

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:17.590
Yes, under orders from Melchior.

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:22.560
He's interested in an artifact
discovered recently at the Maze Pass.

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:24.590
We're to investigate.

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:26.380
Artifact?

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.220
I wonder what they found.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.480
Who cares what it is?

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:33.720
All right, let's go.

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:35.560
To the Maze Pass!

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:49.950
<b>Snowy Mountain Screams</b>

00:23:46.120 --> 00:23:48.770
Fate is set in motion.
